# UX-SPEC §Board · ADR 0023 — a card is worked by pointer alone: dragged to another column, opened
# by double-click, a property changed from its row, a comment written and posted with the
# composer's own Comment button, and the sheet closed by its ✕. The comment is the only typing.
#
# The drag is `press`, a short `move` onto the card's own ⋯ (gpui starts a drag on the first
# motion and holds the preview by that offset), then `move`s into Done, which is empty, so the
# slot opens at its top (see `board/drag-card.scenario`). `card.properties` row 1 is Priority on
# a board nobody automated; the picker's `dialog.row[1]` is High.
#
# Virtual-lane only: it drags and takes shots.
fixture: board
await idle 20000
click hub.tab[2]
await hub_tab == Board 10000
assert lists.board.rows[0].badges[0] == "2" && lists.board.rows[3].label == "Done" && lists.board.rows[3].badges[0] == "0"

press board.column[0].card[0]
move board.column[0].card[0].menu
move board.column[3]
move board.column[3]
shot dragging
release board.column[3]
await lists.board.rows[3].badges[0] == "1" 10000
assert lists.board.rows[0].badges[0] == "1"
await focused == "board.column[3].card[0]" 5000
assert lists["board.cards"].rows[0].badges[0] == "FLT-1"

click left 2 board.column[3].card[0]
await dialog.name == CardDetail 10000
await idle 10000
assert lists["card.properties"].rows[0].label == "Status" && lists["card.properties"].rows[0].badges[0] == "Done"
assert lists["card.properties"].rows[1].label == "Priority" && lists["card.properties"].rows[1].badges[0] == "–"

click card_detail.property[1]
await dialog.name == CardPicker 10000
await targets["dialog.row[1]"] exists 10000
click dialog.row[1]
await dialog.name == CardDetail 15000
await lists["card.properties"].rows[1].badges[0] == "High" 15000

click card_detail.comment
await targets["card_detail.edit.save"] exists 5000
type Dragged here by the pointer journey.
click card_detail.edit.save
await targets["card_detail.edit.save"] absent 10000
await targets["card_detail.comment"] exists 10000
await idle 10000
shot detail

click card_detail.close
await overlay absent 10000
assert hub_tab == Board && lists.board.rows[3].badges[0] == "1"
quit
